do prop a5668 shelf=no
read a5674
do prop a5674 shelf=yes
read a5692
do rewrite a5692 text="# home-tiling: the home base's panels, laid out by each person (a5496). Alex, 15 Oct: 'I don't want the interface to\n# scroll. I should be able to drag around the different sections, or intuitively collapse them with a menu from the\n# bottom'; and later: pinned things stay (the chat, right), the rest come and go around it, and they slide.\n# Where each panel is, is the viewer's own world data: a surface (role=home-layout, actor=\$me) holding column surfaces,\n# each holding panel notes (role=home-panel): lens= what it shows, lesser= its one-line view, shelf=yes put away. On the\n# layout: big= the panel widened, bigcol= its column. Drag a panel by its title onto another to put it above that one,\n# or onto a column's empty foot to put it last there. ⤢ widens one: its column takes the room and the others in that\n# column fold to their title and one line. – puts it on the shelf (home-panels, in the dock). Nothing scrolls: a panel\n# takes what it needs, and when a column is full they give way, cut and faded at the foot.\nstage : column\n  share 1\n  role stage\n  of prop:role=home-layout,prop:actor=\$me as lay\n  each desk\n  lost : text \"No layout of yours here: a surface in Home base with role=home-layout actor=<you>, holding column surfaces of panel notes (src/desktop/home-layout/layout-alex.desk makes Alex's).\"\n    role hint\n    only when count(prop:role=home-layout,prop:actor=\$me) = 0\ndesk : column\n  share 1\n  role stage\n  top : row\n    role top\n    widgets : row\n      lens home-widgets\n    brand : text \"AGORA\"\n      role brand\n    gap : column\n      share 1\n    how : text \"drag a title to move a panel · ⤢ widens · – shelves it in the dock\"\n      role hint\n    keys : text \"Ctrl+Alt+J or Esc closes\"\n      role meta\n  body : row\n    share 1\n    role body\n    scroll none\n    tiling : row\n      share 13\n      role tiling\n      scroll none\n      of kind:surface,in:\$lay.item as col\n      each column\n    pinned : column\n      let wide = 32 when count(prop:role=home-view,prop:actor=\$me,prop:viewing,-prop:viewing=a5080) + count(prop:role=home-view,prop:actor=\$me,prop:find) > 0\n      let wide = 7 otherwise\n      share \$wide\n      role pinned\n      scroll none\n      lens home-viewer\nclockface : row\n  role clock\n  time : text \"\$k.time\"\n    role clocktime\n  day : text \"\$k.day\"\n    role clockday\ncolumn : column\n  let wide = 3 when \$item = (\$lay.bigcol or \"\")\n  let wide = 1 otherwise\n  share \$wide\n  role tilecol\n  scroll none\n  of kind:note,in:\$col.item,prop:role=home-panel,prop:shelf=no as p\n  each panel\n  foot : column\n    let room = 0 when \$item = (\$lay.bigcol or \"\")\n    let room = 1 otherwise\n    share \$room\n    role tilefoot\n    on drop grip do move \$carried into=\$col\npanel : column\n  role pane\n  role pane.big when \$item = (\$lay.big or \"\")\n  scroll none\n  let w = 1 when \$item = (\$lay.big or \"\")\n  let w = 0 otherwise\n  share \$w\n  on drop grip do move \$carried before=\$p\n  grip : row\n    role panehead\n    carry\n    title : text \"\$title\"\n      role panetitle\n    sum : column\n      role panesum\n      share 1\n      only when (\$p.lesser or \"\") != \"\"\n      lens \$p.lesser\n    gap : column\n      share 1\n      only when (\$p.lesser or \"\") = \"\"\n    wide : text \"⤢\"\n      role tool\n      let was = (\$lay.bigcol or \"\")\n      only when \$item != (\$lay.big or \"\")\n      on click do prop \$lay big=\$p bigcol=\$col\n    narrow : text \"⤡\"\n      role tool\n      let was = (\$lay.bigcol or \"\")\n      only when \$item = (\$lay.big or \"\")\n      on click do prop \$lay big=\"\" bigcol=\"\"\n    away : text \"–\"\n      role tool\n      let was = (\$lay.bigcol or \"\")\n      let out = (\$shelf or \"\")\n      on click when \$item = (\$lay.big or \"\") do prop \$p shelf=yes; do prop \$lay big=\"\" bigcol=\"\"\n      on click when \$item != (\$lay.big or \"\") do prop \$p shelf=yes\n  body : column\n    role panebody\n    only when \$item = (\$lay.big or \"\") or (\$lay.bigcol or \"\") != \$col.item\n    lens \$p.lens"
read a5690
do rewrite a5690 text="# home-panels: the menu from the bottom (a5496): every panel of the viewer's layout (home-tiling) as a chip in the dock,\n# with its one-line view; lit while the panel is out, dim while it is put away. A press puts it away, or brings it back\n# where it was. Placed at the right end of the dock (home-dock, a5500).\nshelf : row\n  role shelf\n  of prop:role=home-layout,prop:actor=\$me as lay\n  each chips\nchips : row\n  role shelf\n  of kind:note,in:\$lay.item,prop:role=home-panel as p\n  each chip\nchip : column\n  role dockchip\n  role dockchip.on when (\$p.shelf or \"\") != \"yes\"\n  let was = (\$lay.bigcol or \"\")\n  on click when (\$p.shelf or \"\") = \"yes\" do prop \$p shelf=no\n  on click when (\$p.shelf or \"\") != \"yes\" and \$item = (\$lay.big or \"\") do prop \$p shelf=yes; do prop \$lay big=\"\" bigcol=\"\"\n  on click when (\$p.shelf or \"\") != \"yes\" and \$item != (\$lay.big or \"\") do prop \$p shelf=yes\n  name : text \"\$title\"\n    role chipname\n    clamp 1\n  sum : column\n    role chipsum\n    only when (\$p.lesser or \"\") != \"\"\n    lens \$p.lesser"
read "home-work-small"
do rewrite "home-work-small" text="# home-work-small: who is at work, in one line (a5496), for its panel title and the shelf.\nn : text \"\$(count(house doing=working)) at work\"\n  role summary"
read "home-work"
do rewrite "home-work" text="# home-work: who of the house is at work now, one panel of the home base (a5208). Split out of home-base by a5496.\nwork : column\n  busy : column\n    of house doing=working as h\n    each busy\n  quiet : text \"Everyone is resting.\"\n    role meta\n    only when count(house doing=working) = 0\nbusy : row\n  role busy\n  dot : text \"•\"\n    role live\n  who : text \"\$h.resident\"\n    role who\n    share 1\n  what : text \"working\"\n    role meta"
read a5682
do rewrite a5682 text="# home-board-small: the board in one line (a5496), for its panel title and the shelf.\nn : text \"\$(count(prop:commission=working) + count(prop:commission=waiting)) working · \$(count(prop:commission=ready) + count(prop:commission=landing)) landing\"\n  role summary"
read a5548
do rewrite a5548 text="# home-board: the board, one panel of the home base (a5208). a5359: commissions in lanes by their commission prop; a card moves when the prop does. Waiting on Alex is the waiting-on-me panel. Split out of home-base by a5496.\n# a5504 (Alex: 'the board looks boring af'): each lane has one colour, used only as small marks (its dot, its count, the\n# rail down its cards). A card is a raised tile; one whose worker is at work this moment breathes (glow); a worker that\n# asks its asker is warm. Cards glide to their new lane when the prop changes (glide, in home-style). Landed is quiet.\ntasks : column\n  let busy = count(house doing=working)\n  head : row\n    role bdhead\n    live : text \"● \$(busy) at work\"\n      role bdlivecount\n      only when busy > 0\n  asked : column\n    role bdlane\n    let nasked = count(prop:commission=asked)\n    only when nasked > 0\n    head : row\n      role bdlanehead\n      dot : text \"●\"\n        role bddot.asked\n      name : text \"ASKED\"\n        role bdlanename\n      n : text \"\$(nasked)\"\n        role bdcount.asked\n    cards : column\n      role bdcards\n      of prop:commission=asked as c\n      each taskcard\n  working : column\n    role bdlane\n    let nwork = count(prop:commission=working) + count(prop:commission=waiting)\n    only when nwork > 0\n    head : row\n      role bdlanehead\n      dot : text \"●\"\n        role bddot.working\n      name : text \"WORKING\"\n        role bdlanename\n      n : text \"\$(nwork)\"\n        role bdcount.working\n    cards : column\n      role bdcards\n      of prop:commission=working as c\n      each taskcard\n    asking : column\n      role bdcards\n      of prop:commission=waiting as c\n      each taskcard\n  ready : column\n    role bdlane\n    let nready = count(prop:commission=ready)\n    only when nready > 0\n    head : row\n      role bdlanehead\n      dot : text \"●\"\n        role bddot.ready\n      name : text \"READY TO LAND\"\n        role bdlanename\n      n : text \"\$(nready)\"\n        role bdcount.ready\n    cards : column\n      role bdcards\n      of prop:commission=ready as c\n      each taskcard\n  landing : column\n    role bdlane\n    let nland = count(prop:commission=landing)\n    only when nland > 0\n    head : row\n      role bdlanehead\n      dot : text \"●\"\n        role bddot.landing\n      name : text \"LANDING\"\n        role bdlanename\n      n : text \"\$(nland)\"\n        role bdcount.landing\n    cards : column\n      role bdcards\n      of prop:commission=landing as c\n      each taskcard\n  landed : column\n    role bdlane\n    let nlanded = count(prop:commission=landed)\n    head : row\n      role bdlanehead\n      dot : text \"●\"\n        role bddot\n      name : text \"LANDED\"\n        role bdlanename\n      n : text \"\$(nlanded)\"\n        role bdcount\n    cards : column\n      role bdcards\n      of prop:commission=landed as c\n      clamp last 3\n      each taskcard\n# one card, folded to its line; a press on its title opens it in place (a5359)\ntaskcard : column\n  role bdcard\n  role bdcard.asked when \$c.commission = \"asked\"\n  role bdcard.working when \$c.commission = \"working\" and count(house doing=working resident=\$c.worker) = 0\n  role bdcard.live when \$c.commission = \"working\" and count(house doing=working resident=\$c.worker) > 0\n  role bdcard.asking when \$c.commission = \"waiting\"\n  role bdcard.ready when \$c.commission = \"ready\"\n  role bdcard.landing when \$c.commission = \"landing\"\n  role bdcard.landed when \$c.commission = \"landed\"\n  fold inline handle cardopen\n  line : row\n    peek\n    role bdline\n    name : column\n      share 1\n      title : text \"\$c.title\"\n        role bdtitle\n        role bdtitle.landed when \$c.commission = \"landed\"\n        clamp 1\n    asks : text \"asks\"\n      role bdstate.asking\n      only when \$c.commission = \"waiting\"\n    who : text \"\$((\$c.asked_by or \$c.owner) or \"\")\"\n      role bdwho\n      only when ((\$c.asked_by or \$c.owner) or \"\") != \"\"\n  more : column\n    role bdmore\n    full : text \"\$c.title\"\n      role cardtitle\n    state : text \"\$((\$c.commission or \"for review\")) · asked by \$((\$c.asked_by or \"nobody\")) · \$((\$c.worker or \"no worker\"))\"\n      role meta\n    words : text \"\$c.text\"\n      marks\n      role cardtext\n      clamp 6\n    notes : column\n      of comments:\$c.item as m\n      each lastnote\n    open : text \"Open\"\n      role chip\n      on click do view \$c.item\nlastnote : column\n  role cardnote\n  only when \$index = \$count\n  by : text \"latest comment, from \$m.by\"\n    role meta\n  said : text \"\$m.text\"\n    marks\n    role cardtext\n    clamp 4"
read a5674
do tag a5674 remove=glance-you,glance-board
read "drop-panel"
do remove "drop-panel"
read "home-feed"
do remove "home-feed"
read a5206
do rewrite a5206 text="font sans = Segoe UI Variable Text, Segoe UI, system-ui, sans-serif\nfont mono = Cascadia Code, ui-monospace, monospace\ntoken night = #0E1211\ntoken paper = #0E1211\ntoken ink = #E9EEEA\ntoken jeff = #B9A4F2\ntoken accent = #8DCDB4\ntoken warm = #F2C98B\ntoken glass = #0E1211A6\ntoken glassdeep = #0E1211D0\ntoken rim = ink at 10%\ntoken soft = ink at 62%\ntoken faint = ink at 14%\ntoken mine = #8DCDB433\ntoken jeffwash = #B9A4F222\ntoken wash = #E9EEEA12\ntoken focus = accent at 40%\ntoken scrollbar = ink at 22%\ntoken scrollbar_w = 5\ntoken gap = 8\ntoken ramp = 1.16\ntoken text = sans 15/1.55\ntoken text.mono = mono 12/1.5\nrole desk : ink, text\nrole page : ink, text\nrole home : ink, text, pad gap x2\nrole bar : pad bottom gap x2, between gap x2\nrole brand : text.mono down tracked, accent\nrole place : text medium, ink\nrole meta : text down, soft\nrole body : between gap x2\nrole side : between gap x2\nrole panel : on glass, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap x2, between gap\nrole heading : text up medium, ink\nrole prose : text, ink, space above gap\nrole busy : between gap, pad top gap /2\nrole live : accent\nrole who : text medium, ink\nrole who.jeff : text medium, jeff\nrole tiles : between gap x1.5\nrole tile : on glass, edge rim, corner gap x1.5, pad gap, between gap /2\nrole tile.front : on glassdeep, edge accent, corner gap x1.5, pad gap, between gap /2\nrole thumb : on wash, corner gap, height gap x19\nrole tilename : text down medium, ink\nrole chat : ink, text\nrole room : on glassdeep, edge rim, corner gap x2, lift gap\nrole chathead : pad gap x2, border bottom rim, between gap x1.5\nrole face : on jeffwash, jeff, text up 2 strong, corner gap x3, pad gap, pad left gap x2, pad right gap x2\nrole chatname : text up 2 strong, ink\nrole thinking : text down, jeff\nrole tabs : between gap /2\nrole tab : text down, soft, pad gap /2, pad left gap, pad right gap, corner gap\nrole tab.on : text down medium, ink, on wash, pad gap /2, pad left gap, pad right gap, corner gap\nrole feed : pad gap x2, between gap /2\nrole said : align start, width 46em, space above gap /2\nrole said.mine : align end, width 46em, space above gap /2\nrole saidhead : between gap, pad bottom gap /2, space above gap\nrole bubble : on wash, corner gap x1.5, pad gap x1.5\nrole bubble.mine : on mine, corner gap x1.5, pad gap x1.5\nrole bubble.jeff : on jeffwash, corner gap x1.5, pad gap x1.5\nrole words : text, ink\nrole acts : shy, pad left gap\nrole tool : text down, soft, pad gap /2\nrole working : pad left gap x2\nrole typingrow : between gap, pad bottom gap /2\nrole dots : jeff\nrole dock : on glass, border top rim, pad gap x2, between gap\nrole answering : on wash, corner gap, pad gap, between gap\nrole to : between gap /2\nrole chip : text down, soft, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap x1.5\nrole chip.on : text down medium, night, on accent, corner gap x2, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap x1.5\nrole input : text, ink, on wash, corner gap x1.5, pad gap x1.5\nrole button : on accent, night, text down medium, pad gap, pad left gap x2, pad right gap x2, corner gap x2\nrole hint : text down 2, soft\nrole attachment : on wash, corner gap, pad gap, between gap\nrole attachthumb : corner gap /2, width gap x14\nrole mark : ink\nrole menu.item : text down, ink, pad gap\nrole popup : on glassdeep, edge rim, corner gap, pad gap\nrole code : text.mono, on wash, corner gap /2\nrole hello : pad gap x3, between gap, space below gap x2\nrole waithead : between gap\nrole waitdesk : between gap x1.5\nrole waitlist : between gap /2\nrole wait : on wash, corner gap, pad gap, between gap /4\nrole wait.on : on mine, edge accent, corner gap, pad gap, between gap /4\nrole waitfacts : between gap\nrole reviewcard : on glassdeep, edge accent, corner gap x1.5, pad gap x1.5, between gap\nrole reviewacts : between gap, space above gap /2\nrole lane : between gap /2, space above gap\nrole lanename : text down medium tracked, soft\nrole lanecards : between gap /2\nrole taskcard : on wash, edge faint, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap, pad right gap\nrole taskcard.live : on wash, edge accent, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap, pad right gap\nrole cardtitle : text down medium, ink\nrole cardline : between gap\nrole cardwho : text down, soft\nrole cardlane : text down 2, soft\nrole still : faint\nrole cardopen : text down 2, soft\nrole cardmore : between gap /2, pad top gap /2, pad bottom gap /2, space above gap /2, border top rim\nrole cardnote : between gap /4, pad left gap, border left rim\nrole cardtext : text down, soft\nrole cut : text down, soft\n# a5398: the home base's viewer (home-viewer, home-note, home-chat, home-surface)\nrole viewer : between gap\nrole findbar : between gap, on glass, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap /2, pad left gap\nrole find : text, ink, on wash, corner gap x1.5, pad gap\nrole pins : between gap /2\nrole found : on glassdeep, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap x1.5, between gap /2\nrole foundlist : between gap /4\nrole hit : between gap, pad gap /2, corner gap\nrole shown : on glassdeep, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap x2, between gap\nrole viewhead : between gap, pad bottom gap, border bottom rim\nrole viewlanes : between gap\nrole viewlane : on wash, corner gap x1.5, pad gap, between gap\nrole viewlanehead : text down medium, soft\nrole viewlanelist : between gap /2\nrole viewcard : on glass, edge rim, corner gap, pad gap, between gap /4\nrole viewcard.p1 : on glass, edge warm, corner gap, pad gap, between gap /4\nrole viewcardtitle : text down, ink\nrole docheading : text up medium, ink, space above gap\n# a5504: the waiting list opens in place (waiting-on-me), and a demo opened inside a card wears this style: report..composer are the demo lens's own role names\nrole count : text down medium, night, on accent, corner gap x2, pad left gap, pad right gap\nrole tag : text down 2 tracked, soft\nrole tag.demo : text down 2 medium tracked, warm\nrole tag.design : text down 2 medium tracked, jeff\nrole waithit : between gap /4\nrole reviewbody : between gap, pad top gap, border top rim\nrole demo : on night, edge rim, corner gap, pad gap, height gap x60\nrole report : on wash, ink, text, pad gap x1.5, edge rim, corner gap x1.5\nrole eyebrow : text.mono tracked, accent, space below gap\nrole title : text up strong, ink\nrole subtitle : text down, soft, space below gap\nrole check : on wash, pad gap, corner gap, space below gap\nrole label : text medium, ink\nrole good : text.mono strong, accent, pad left gap\nrole detail : text down, soft, space above gap /2\nrole boundary : text down 2, soft, space above gap\nrole message : pad gap /2, space below gap\nrole author : text down medium, accent\nrole composer : text, ink, on wash, corner gap, pad gap\n# a5500: the dock along the foot of the home base (home-dock)\nrole appfoot : pad top gap x2\nrole appdock : on glassdeep, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap, pad left gap x2, pad right gap x2\nrole appshelf : between gap x1.5\nrole appicons : between gap\nrole appslot : between gap /4\nrole appicon : on wash, edge faint, corner gap x1.5, pad gap, width gap x11, between gap /4\nrole appicon.on : on mine, edge accent, corner gap x1.5, pad gap, width gap x11, between gap /4\nrole appadd : on glass, edge rim, soft, corner gap x1.5, pad gap, width gap x11, between gap /4\nrole appglyph : text up 3, ink, align center\nrole applabel : text down 2, soft, align center\n# a5504: the board (home-board): one colour per lane, used only as small marks (a dot, a rail, a count); a card is a raised tile; a card whose worker is at work has an edge in its lane colour (a5816, Alex 16 Oct: no breathing, no glide, no pulse, wave or hover lift anywhere in this style; only the pomodoro ring moves)\ntoken shadow = #000000\ntoken sky = #8FB8F2\ntoken teal = #7FD1E0\ntoken raised = #E9EEEA0D\ntoken raisedhi = #E9EEEA17\ntoken skywash = #8FB8F226\ntoken jeffwash2 = #B9A4F226\ntok